Number of frames to capture (1-100, default: 20)
.It Fl f Ar format
Output format (text, json)
.It Fl n Ar name
Instance name
.It Fl v
Verbose output
.El
.It Xo
.Nm emu
.Ar test
.Op Fl n Ar name
.Op Fl t Ar timeout
.Op Fl v
.Xc
Run tests in an emulated instance.
.Bl -tag -width Fl -compact
.It Fl n Ar name
Instance name
